    "body": "ZORR MODE\n\nTYPE = WORLD / STORY MEMORY RECOVERY\nSTATUS = RECOVERY CANDIDATE / OWNER REVIEW REQUIRED\nBASE_MAIN = b18ca6b9cce2dce6fe304ca8ae36c05df4f4dcb1\nCANON_MUTATION = NO\nPRODUCTION_MUTATION = NO\nAUTO_MERGE = NO\n\n## PURPOSE\nCreate a clean durable World Bible candidate for DUNCAN PRIME Business cold-start without importing the old chat/history dump as authority.\n\n## ADDED\n- `docs/canon/ZORR_WORLD_BIBLE_R01.md`\n- `docs/canon/ZORR_WORLD_BIBLE_R01.json`\n\n## STATUS SEPARATION\n- `LOCKED_CORE`\n- `APPROVED_STORY_FACT`\n- `RECOVERED_STORY_SOURCE`\n- `OPEN`\n- `QUARANTINE`\n- `SOURCE_ONLY`\n\n## IMPORTANT CONFLICT RESOLUTION\n`Тысячный Союз` is preserved as existing in recovered Arc II story evidence because Орсон Дейк and Райсо identify with its `Клятвенный корпус`, while the old expanded doctrine/history remains `QUARANTINE`.\n\n`ENTITY EXISTS IN STORY != ALL OLD LORE ABOUT THAT ENTITY IS CONFIRMED`\n\n## SOURCES USED\n- `ZORR_CANON_CORE_R02_MINIMAL.md/json`\n- `ZORR_LORE_QUARANTINE_R01.md`\n- recovered Library story material for Arc I / Arc II\n- GitHub issue #93 exact sections labeled `APPROVED ZB FACTS ONLY`\n- GitHub issue #197 SOURCE_ONLY boundary\n\n## OWNER REVIEW GATE\nThis PR must not be merged or used as a higher authority until OWNER reviews the recovered story facts and status split.\n\n`RECOVERY_COMPLETE != CANON_PROMOTED`\n\nMERGE = NO\nNEXT = OWNER review of World Bible R01 candidate",
